msgid "# Speculative Decoding KV Sliding Window"
msgstr "# 推测解码 KV 滑动窗口"

msgid ""
"Speculative decoding draft models are typically trained on short contexts\n"
"(e.g. 4-8K tokens). At inference time, when the running context grows far\n"
"beyond the training length, the draft's attention over the full KV cache goes\n"
"out-of-distribution and acceptance collapses: on GLM-5.2 with an early DSpark\n"
"draft, the mean acceptance length dropped from ~5 to ~1 at 32K context, making\n"
"speculation a net loss."
msgstr ""
"推测解码的草稿模型通常在短上下文（例如 4-8K tokens）上训练。在推理时，当运行上下文远超训练长度时，草稿模型对完整 KV "
"缓存的注意力会超出分布范围，接受率随之崩溃：在 GLM-5.2 搭配早期 DSpark 草稿模型时，平均接受长度在 32K 上下文下从约 5 降至约 "
"1，使得推测成为净损失。"

msgid ""
"The KV sliding window caps the **draft model's attention** to the most recent\n"
"`draft_window_size` tokens. The target model is untouched - it always attends\n"
"to the full context, so generation quality is preserved; only the draft reads\n"
"a shorter, in-distribution window. On acceptance-collapsed drafts this\n"
"restores acceptance (the same GLM-5.2 draft recovered from ~1.0 to ~4.7-5.5\n"
"at 32K, up to +381% end-to-end throughput in the original evaluation)."
msgstr ""
"KV 滑动窗口将**草稿模型的注意力**限制在最近的 `draft_window_size` 个 token "
"上。目标模型不受影响——它始终关注完整上下文，因此生成质量得以保留；只有草稿模型读取更短的、在分布内的窗口。对于接受率崩溃的草稿模型，这能恢复接受率（同一"
" GLM-5.2 草稿模型在 32K 上下文下从约 1.0 恢复到约 4.7-5.5，在原始评估中端到端吞吐量提升高达 +381%）。"

msgid "## Configuration"
msgstr "## 配置"

msgid ""
"The window is enabled through `additional_config` and is available for the\n"
"EAGLE3 / DFlash / DSpark draft paths on the default (MRV1) model runner:"
msgstr ""
"该窗口通过 `additional_config` 启用，适用于默认（MRV1）模型运行器上的 EAGLE3 / DFlash / DSpark "
"草稿路径："

msgid ""
"It is disabled by default (key absent). MTP force-disables it (MTP reuses the\n"
"target's own layers, so windowing the draft would window the target); for a\n"
"DSpark draft that was natively trained together with a DeepSeek-V4 target, a\n"
"warning is logged because the draft is already long-context stable and\n"
"windowing degrades acceptance."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下该功能处于禁用状态（键不存在）。MTP 会强制禁用该功能（MTP 复用目标模型自身的层，因此对草稿模型加窗口等同于对目标模型加窗口）；对于与 "
"DeepSeek-V4 目标模型原生联合训练的 DSpark 草稿模型，会记录一条警告，因为该草稿模型已具备长上下文稳定性，加窗口会降低接受率。"

msgid "## Window math"
msgstr "## 窗口计算"

msgid ""
"Let `W` be the window size, `b` the kernel block size, `K = future_offset`\n"
"the number of draft query positions lying beyond the `seq_lens` value the\n"
"adapter sees. The adapter computes, entirely on device:"
msgstr ""
"设 `W` 为窗口大小，`b` 为内核块大小，`K = future_offset` 为超出适配器所见的 `seq_lens` "
"值的草稿查询位置数量。适配器完全在设备上计算："

msgid ""
"`future_offset` differs by draft family because their `seq_lens` semantics\n"
"differ:"
msgstr "`future_offset` 因草稿模型家族而异，因为它们的 `seq_lens` 语义不同："

msgid "| Method | future_offset | Why |"
msgstr "| Method | future_offset | Why |"

msgid ""
"| EAGLE3 | `num_speculative_tokens` | `seq_lens` is context-only; the K "
"draft positions lie beyond it, so the window end must cover `seq_lens + K`. "
"|"
msgstr ""
"| EAGLE3 | `num_speculative_tokens` | `seq_lens` 仅包含上下文；K "
"个草稿位置超出其范围，因此窗口末尾必须覆盖 `seq_lens + K`。 |"

msgid ""
"| DFlash / DSpark | `0` | the input-preparation kernel already bakes the "
"query stretch (bonus + mask tokens) into `seq_lens`, so `final = seq_lens`. "
"|"
msgstr ""
"| DFlash / DSpark | `0` | 输入预处理内核已将查询扩展（bonus + mask tokens）融入 `seq_lens`，因此"
" `final = seq_lens`。 |"

msgid ""
"The block table is cropped by gathering columns\n"
"`start_block[i] + [0, max_window_blocks)` from the full table into a\n"
"zero-padded clone; columns past `needed` (and past the full-table width) are\n"
"zeroed. Zeroed columns are never read because every FIA KV-length input is\n"
"capped at the same `windowed_len`."
msgstr ""
"块表通过从完整表中收集列 `start_block[i] + [0, max_window_blocks)` 到零填充的克隆来进行裁剪；超出 "
"`needed`（以及超出完整表宽度）的列被置零。置零的列永远不会被读取，因为每个 FIA KV 长度输入都被限制在相同的 "
"`windowed_len`。"

msgid "Two invariants hold throughout:"
msgstr "以下两个不变量始终成立："

msgid ""
"- **slot_mapping is never windowed.** Draft KV writes still go through the\n"
"  full block table at absolute positions, so the cache stays coherent for the\n"
"  target model and for window sizes changed between steps.\n"
"- **Only what FIA reads is capped.** The FIA kernel's KV-length inputs are the\n"
"  NPU `seq_lens` tensor plus CPU mirrors (`seq_lens_cpu`, `_seq_lens_cpu`,\n"
"  `seq_lens_cpu_upper_bound`); all of them are windowed with the same\n"
"  arithmetic so no path can read past the window."
msgstr ""
"- **slot_mapping 永远不会被加窗口。** 草稿 KV 写入仍通过绝对位置的完整块表进行，因此缓存对目标模型以及在步骤之间更改窗口大小的情况下保持一致性。\n"
"- **只有 FIA 读取的内容被限制。** FIA 内核的 KV 长度输入为 NPU `seq_lens` 张量加上 CPU 镜像（`seq_lens_cpu`、`_seq_lens_cpu`、`seq_lens_cpu_upper_bound`）；所有这些都使用相同的算术进行窗口化，因此没有任何路径可以读取超出窗口的内容。"

msgid "## MRV1 implementation"
msgstr "## MRV1 实现"

msgid ""
"`SlidingWindowAdapter` (`vllm_ascend/spec_decode/utils.py`) owns the math\n"
"above and a persistent `[max_num_reqs, max_window_blocks]` clone buffer. It is\n"
"constructed in `AscendSpecDecodeBaseProposer.__init__`\n"
"(`vllm_ascend/spec_decode/llm_base_proposer.py`) when `draft_window_size` is\n"
"set, then applied to the draft's `common_attn_metadata` **before** the\n"
"per-layer metadata is built."
msgstr ""
"`SlidingWindowAdapter`（`vllm_ascend/spec_decode/utils.py`）负责上述计算以及一个持久的 "
"`[max_num_reqs, max_window_blocks]` 克隆缓冲区。当设置了 `draft_window_size` 时，它在 "
"`AscendSpecDecodeBaseProposer.__init__`（`vllm_ascend/spec_decode/llm_base_proposer.py`）中构建，然后在构建逐层元数据**之前**应用于草稿模型的"
" `common_attn_metadata`。"

msgid ""
"There are two apply points because of how the drafts construct metadata:"
msgstr "由于草稿模型构建元数据的方式不同，有两个应用点："

msgid ""
"- EAGLE3 / DFlash: applied once in `_propose` on the shared\n"
"  `common_attn_metadata` (`llm_base_proposer.py`).\n"
"- DSpark: that path is bypassed - the dspark branch of\n"
"  `build_draft_attn_metadata` overwrites\n"
"  `common_attn_metadata.block_table_tensor` with a per-group full table before\n"
"  building. The adapter is therefore applied **after** the per-group overwrite\n"
"  and before `builder.build_for_drafting`, so FIA reads the windowed clone of\n"
"  the per-group table instead of the full one."
msgstr ""
"- EAGLE3 / DFlash：在 `_propose` 中对共享的 `common_attn_metadata` 应用一次（`llm_base_proposer.py`）。\n"
"- DSpark：该路径被绕过——`build_draft_attn_metadata` 的 dspark 分支在构建前用逐组的完整表覆盖 `common_attn_metadata.block_table_tensor`。因此适配器在逐组覆盖**之后**、`builder.build_for_drafting` 之前应用，这样 FIA 读取的是逐组表的窗口化克隆，而不是完整表。"

msgid "## MRV2 status"
msgstr "## MRV2 状态"

msgid ""
"Model Runner V2 is not yet covered by this feature. The MRV2 speculator\n"
"system bakes `seq_lens` / block tables into the final per-layer metadata\n"
"inside `build_attn_metadata` - there is no shared `common_attn_metadata` to\n"
"mutate after the build, so porting the window requires applying it to the\n"
"**builder inputs** (windowed `input_buffers.seq_lens`, gathered per-group\n"
"block-table clones, capped `seq_lens_cpu_upper_bound`) around the\n"
"`_build_draft_attn_metadata` call in\n"
"`vllm_ascend/worker/v2/spec_decode/dspark/speculator.py`. The window math\n"
"and the two invariants above carry over unchanged."
msgstr ""
"Model Runner V2 尚未被此功能覆盖。MRV2 推测器系统在 `build_attn_metadata` 内部将 `seq_lens` / "
"块表融入最终的逐层元数据——构建后没有共享的 `common_attn_metadata` "
"可供修改，因此移植该窗口需要将其应用于**构建器输入**（窗口化的 `input_buffers.seq_lens`、收集的逐组块表克隆、受限的 "
"`seq_lens_cpu_upper_bound`），围绕 "
"`vllm_ascend/worker/v2/spec_decode/dspark/speculator.py` 中的 "
"`_build_draft_attn_metadata` 调用。窗口计算和上述两个不变量保持不变。"

msgid "## Expected behavior"
msgstr "## 预期行为"

msgid ""
"- Drafts trained on short contexts that collapse on long inputs (acceptance\n"
"  dropping with context length): the window restores acceptance up to the\n"
"  draft's short-context level. The gain grows with input length.\n"
"- Drafts already stable at long context (recently trained drafts, or drafts\n"
"  with their own SWA structure): the window provides no benefit and can hurt\n"
"  if set **below** the draft's training window - the draft expects to see\n"
"  more context than the window allows. Rule of thumb: keep\n"
"  `draft_window_size` at or above the draft's training/native window, or\n"
"  leave it off when acceptance is already flat across context lengths.\n"
"- End-to-end effect combines the acceptance change with the draft's reduced\n"
"  KV-read cost; with no acceptance gain the two roughly cancel."
msgstr ""
"- 在短上下文上训练、在长输入上崩溃的草稿模型（接受率随上下文长度下降）：窗口将接受率恢复到草稿模型的短上下文水平。收益随输入长度增长。\n"
"- 在长上下文下已经稳定的草稿模型（近期训练的草稿模型，或具有自身 SWA 结构的草稿模型）：窗口不提供收益，如果设置**低于**草稿模型的训练窗口反而可能有害——草稿模型期望看到的上下文比窗口允许的更多。经验法则：保持 `draft_window_size` 等于或高于草稿模型的训练/原生窗口，或者当接受率在各上下文长度下已经平稳时关闭该功能。\n"
"- 端到端效果结合了接受率变化与草稿模型 KV 读取成本的降低；如果没有接受率收益，两者大致相互抵消。"

msgid "## Related Files"
msgstr "## 相关文件"

msgid ""
"- Shared window adapter: `vllm_ascend/spec_decode/utils.py`\n"
"- MRV1 proposer (apply points, config validation): `vllm_ascend/spec_decode/llm_base_proposer.py`"
msgstr ""
"- 共享窗口适配器：`vllm_ascend/spec_decode/utils.py`\n"
"- MRV1 提议器（应用点、配置验证）：`vllm_ascend/spec_decode/llm_base_proposer.py`"
